flowchart LR
    I[Image Upload] --> V[Flask /api/detect/image]
    V --> S[Save to uploads/]
    S --> P[OpenCV Decode]
    P --> F[Fire/Smoke Detection]
    P --> O[YOLO Object Detection]
    F --> C[Confidence Aggregation and Boxes]
    O --> C
    C --> T[Status Calculation]
    T --> J[JSON Result]
    J --> UI[Dashboard Cards and Preview]
    J --> H[SQLite Alert History]

    F -->|fire_confidence, smoke_confidence| C
    O -->|people, animals, vehicles| C
    T -->|SAFE, WARNING, FIRE ALERT| J
